            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is how 'mini.files' works: it does not use `<CR>` to \"select a file\" in favor of a more general [`l` for \"go in\"](https://github.com/nvim-mini/MiniMax/blob/515c6ea7361ab11d8f6024e35b4068b06e528aed/configs/nvim-0.11/plugin/30_mini.lua#L431-L435). You can adjust this by using [`config.mappings`](https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-files.html#minifiles.config-mappings) inside `require('mini.files').setup()`.",
